{"id":206,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"The nests Dunsparce live in are mazes of tunnels. They never get lost in their own nests—they can tell where they are by the scent of the dirt."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"This Pokémon’s tiny wings have some scientists saying that Dunsparce used to fly through the sky in ancient times."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"When it sees a person, it digs a hole with its tail to make its escape. If you happen to find one, consider yourself lucky."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It travels by digging through the ground. Diglett and Dunsparce share one another’s tunnels happily."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby"],"text":"Dunsparce has a drill for its tail. It uses this tail to burrow into the ground backward. This Pokémon is known to make its nest in complex shapes deep under the ground."},{"games":["Y","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It digs into the ground with its tail and makes a mazelike nest. It can fly just a little."},{"games":["X","HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"When spotted, this Pokémon escapes backward by furiously boring into the ground with its tail."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"It creates mazes in dark locations. When spotted, it flees into the ground by digging with its tail."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"If spotted, it escapes by burrowing with its tail. It can float just slightly using its wings."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"If spotted, it escapes by burrowing with its tail. It can hover just slightly using its wings."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Its drill-tipped tail is used to burrow into the ground backwards. This POKéMON is known to make its nest in complex shapes deep under the ground."},{"games":["Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"DUNSPARCE has a drill for its tail. It uses this tail to burrow into the ground backwards. This POKéMON is known to make its nest in complex shapes deep under the ground."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"It hides deep 